==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|safna}}, from {{der|is|non|safna}}, a by-form of {{m|non|samna||to collect, assemble}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*samnōną||to gather, collect}}. More at {{l|en|sam}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/sapn/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|apn|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|n|safns|söfn}}

# {{lb|is|institution}} a [[museum]]
# a [[collection]]
# a [[flock]] of [[sheep]]

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-n-s|s|a|fn}}

