==Welsh==

===Etymology===
Ultimately from {{der|cy|ine-pro|*stómn̥||mouth, muzzle}}. Compare {{cog|kw|sâwn}}, {{cog|kw|sawan|t=chasm}}, {{cog|br|staoñ|t=palate}}.

===Noun===
{{cy-noun|mf|safnau|dim=sefnyn}}

# [[mouth]], [[jaws]]

====Usage notes====
Sometimes derogatory when applied to people.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|mouth}} {{l|cy|ceg}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|cy|safnaid||mouthful}}
* {{l|cy|safnrhwth||open-mouthed}}

